            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>New app icon: a heartbeat that flatlines into a terminal cursor</li>
  <li>Offers to start at login the first time it runs from Applications</li>
  <li>Settings switches and pickers now use your accent color</li>
  <li>Uses about 5 MB less memory after the popover closes</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
