        <item>
            <title>0.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:17:58 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://flatline.banast.as</link>
            <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>First build.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Menu bar readout of CPU, memory and network, as text, a mini trace, or both</li>
  <li>Popover with 60-second traces, per-core load split by Performance and Efficiency clusters, memory breakdown with pressure, network totals and active interface</li>
  <li>Settings for metrics, styles, units, refresh rate, accent color and launch at login</li>
  <li>Automatic updates, checked daily</li>
  <li>About 0.07% CPU at a 1-second refresh</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
